#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:1
#: b5182f8e02bb4d7d92b83b75ac3cd011
msgid "从整体组成到数值分布"
msgstr "From overall composition to numerical distributions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:3
#: 8618887ed45745cf832a6da302ef2189
msgid ""
"拿到陌生训练集时，先回答两个问题：数据由哪些元素组合构成、关键物理量是否存在"
"覆盖空缺或异常长尾。主工具栏中的 `Training Set Audit` 负责整体组成和证据概"
"览，`Explore distributions` 负责展开具体数值字段。"
msgstr ""
"When opening an unfamiliar training set, first ask which element "
"combinations it contains and whether important physical quantities have "
"coverage gaps or abnormal tails. `Training Set Audit` in the main toolbar "
"provides the overall composition and evidence overview, while `Explore "
"distributions` expands individual numerical fields."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:5
#: e3e8a925320b44eebdcf0061c507b737
msgid "先看训练集整体"
msgstr "Start with the complete training set"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:7
#: cdd011db560b48559d1e116cec9624d0
msgid ""
"加载数据后，点击主工具栏中的 `Training Set Audit`。概览页会直接展示结构数、原"
"子数、元素数和标签可用性，并用元素共现矩阵呈现训练集中一元、二元及多元组合的"
"整体覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"After loading data, click `Training Set Audit` in the main toolbar. The "
"overview shows structure, atom, and element counts together with label "
"availability, and uses an element co-occurrence matrix to summarize unary, "
"binary, and multicomponent coverage."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: 27825af79e4049629504711a24bc4705
msgid "训练集评估概览"
msgstr "Training set check overview"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: 27825af79e4049629504711a24bc4705
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dataset_summary.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:14
#: 80ea8c72dca84feeb2bb2f0a354c71a7
msgid ""
"共现矩阵中的非对角单元格表示两个元素在同一结构中出现的频率；对角线表示单元素"
"结构。点击一个元素后，左侧会聚焦显示与它相关的组合，便于查看它与哪些元素共同"
"出现、哪些组合稀少或完全缺失。元素集合表保留精确的组合与占比，适合进一步核"
"对。"
msgstr ""
"Off-diagonal matrix cells show how often two elements occur in the same "
"structure; diagonal cells represent single-element structures. Clicking an "
"element focuses the related combinations, making rare or missing "
"combinations easier to spot. The element-set table retains exact "
"combinations and shares for verification."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:16
#: bf7c895c280c4717a50e429366aeed9f
msgid ""
"这个页面取代了旧的 `Dataset summary` 弹窗。整体统计、元素组合和后续证据现在都"
"在同一处查看，不再需要从保存菜单进入独立摘要。"
msgstr ""
"This page replaces the former `Dataset summary` dialog. Overall statistics, "
"element combinations, and follow-up evidence now live in one place instead "
"of a separate summary under the Save menu."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:18
#: 69c7bac4e3884d4aa8499a243884c2e9
msgid "再看力等关键字段"
msgstr "Inspect Forces and Other Key Fields"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:20
#: 835eabc10c734584952db3b0fec25650
msgid ""
"回到数据展示页，打开 `Explore distributions`，选择数据字段、统计范围和分组方"
"式。本例查看 `force`，按元素分组，并用力的模长作横坐标："
msgstr ""
"Return to Dataset Display, open `Explore distributions`, and choose a field, "
"scope, and grouping mode. This example inspects `force`, groups by element, "
"and uses force magnitude on the x-axis:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:22
#: 69d9fac64827480db01405316347774e
msgid "按元素统计的原子力分布"
msgstr "Atomic-force distributions grouped by element"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:22
#: 69d9fac64827480db01405316347774e
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:27
#: 5e630d87cb72412cafe6684e952fde83
msgid ""
"分布图可以比较不同元素或标签的覆盖范围，也可以切换参考值、预测值或误差，用同"
"样方法检查能量、应力和磁力等字段。"
msgstr ""
"The distribution chart compares coverage across elements or labels. Switch "
"among reference, prediction, and error views to inspect energy, stress, "
"magnetic force, and other fields in the same way."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:29
#: f14d29f149b54aa29de1395537dfd1c0
msgid ""
"概览负责发现“哪些组合存在或缺失”，数值分布负责发现“标签覆盖是否均衡”。发现孤"
"立尖峰、异常长尾或某个组明显偏移后，再回到主界面选中对应结构，结合几何和原始"
"计算结果复核。"
msgstr ""
"The overview reveals which combinations exist or are missing; numerical "
"distributions reveal whether label coverage is balanced. After finding "
"isolated spikes, abnormal tails, or shifted groups, return to the main view "
"and inspect the corresponding structures against their geometry and source "
"calculations."

